{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/hyperparametertuning"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Finding the optimal combination of hyperparameters is critical for maximizing generalization accuracy. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftOptimize"},{"type":"text","text":" provides exhaustive grid search, randomized sampling for high-dimensional parameter spaces, and end-to-end "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AutoML"},{"type":"text","text":" selection across multiple model families."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","text":"1. AutoML — Automated Model Selection","anchor":"1-AutoML-Automated-Model-Selection","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AutoML"},{"type":"text","text":" cross-validates a fixed set of baseline architectures (Logistic\/Linear Regression, Decision Tree, Random Forest, MLP) and ranks them by the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"mean per-fold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" score: macro F1 for classification, R² for regression. Classification uses "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/StratifiedKFold","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; regression uses shuffled "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/KFold","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". All metrics come from "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/EvaluationHarness","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","import SwiftOptimize","import SwiftML","","\/\/ 1. Synthetic classification dataset","let N = 120","let D = 4","let X = (0..<N).map { i in","    (0..<D).map { d in Double(i * D + d) * 0.05 + sin(Double(i + d)) }","}","let y = (0..<N).map { i in Double(i % 2) }","","\/\/ 2. Configure AutoML with 3-fold stratified cross-validation","let autoML = AutoML(","    timeBudgetSeconds: 30,","    taskType: .classification,","    nFolds: 3,","    seed: 42",")","","\/\/ 3. Run model selection","let report = try await autoML.fit(features: X, targets: y)","","print(\"Best model: \\(await autoML.bestModelName ?? \"-\")\")","print(\"CV macro F1: \\(report.metrics[\"cv_score\"]!) ± \\(report.metrics[\"cv_std\"]!)\")","","for entry in await autoML.leaderboard {","    print(entry.displayName, entry.meanScore, entry.foldScores)","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Task type:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".auto","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (default) classifies integer targets with ≤ 10 distinct values, treats non-integer or high-cardinality targets as regression, and throws "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/AutoMLError\/ambiguousTaskType(uniqueValues:sampleCount:)"},{"type":"text","text":" in between. Pass "},{"code":"taskType","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" explicitly in that case."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Time budget:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" soft. It is checked before each candidate and fold; a running fit is not interrupted, and the first candidate always completes."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Search:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" only "},{"code":".modelSelection","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is available. To tune hyperparameters of a single estimator, use "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/GridSearchCV"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/RandomizedSearchCV"},{"type":"text","text":" below."}]}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","text":"2. Exhaustive Grid Search (`GridSearchCV`)","anchor":"2-Exhaustive-Grid-Search-GridSearchCV","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GridSearchCV"},{"type":"text","text":" exhaustively tests all Cartesian combinations of hyperparameter discrete values."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiftOptimize","import SwiftML","","\/\/ Define hyperparameter search grid for DecisionTreeClassifier","let paramGrid: [String: [Any]] = [","    \"maxDepth\": [3, 5, 8],","    \"minSamplesSplit\": [2, 5, 10],","    \"criterion\": [\"gini\", \"entropy\"]","]","","let gridSearch = GridSearchCV(","    estimator: DecisionTreeClassifier(maxDepth: 3),","    paramGrid: paramGrid,","    cv: 5,","    scoring: .accuracy",")","","try await gridSearch.fit(features: X, targets: y)","","if let bestParams = gridSearch.bestParams {","    print(\"Optimal Depth: \\(bestParams[\"maxDepth\"] ?? \"default\")\")","    print(\"Peak CV Accuracy: \\(String(format: \"%.4f\", gridSearch.bestScore ?? 0.0))\")","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","text":"3. Randomized Search (`RandomizedSearchCV`)","anchor":"3-Randomized-Search-RandomizedSearchCV","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When searching through large continuous or discrete combinatorial spaces, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RandomizedSearchCV"},{"type":"text","text":" samples $N$ random configurations, finding near-optimal solutions in a fraction of the compute time."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiftOptimize","import SwiftML","","let distributions: [String: [Any]] = [","    \"learningRate\": [0.001, 0.005, 0.01, 0.05, 0.1],","    \"epochs\": [100, 200, 500, 1000],","    \"l2Penalty\": [0.0, 0.0001, 0.001, 0.01]","]","","let randomSearch = RandomizedSearchCV(","    estimator: LogisticRegression(learningRate: 0.01),","    paramDistributions: distributions,","    nIter: 20,","    cv: 3,","    randomSeed: 42",")","","try await randomSearch.fit(features: X, targets: y)","print(\"Top Configuration Score: \\(randomSearch.bestScore ?? 0.0)\")"],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/HyperparameterTuning"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Hyperparameter Tuning & AutoML Engine","modules":[{"name":"SwiftOptimize"}]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/CrossValidationFolds","doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/ParallelModelSelection"],"title":"Guides & Tutorials","anchor":"Guides--Tutorials"}],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Automate model exploration and parameter optimization with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GridSearchCV"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RandomizedSearchCV"},{"type":"text","text":", and the intelligent "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AutoML"},{"type":"text","text":" model selector."}],"references":{"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/AutoMLError/ambiguousTaskType(uniqueValues:sampleCount:)":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ambiguousTaskType","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"uniqueValues","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sampleCount","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"code":".auto","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" could not confidently decide between classification and regression."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/automlerror\/ambiguoustasktype(uniquevalues:samplecount:)","title":"AutoMLError.ambiguousTaskType(uniqueValues:sampleCount:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/AutoMLError\/ambiguousTaskType(uniqueValues:sampleCount:)"},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/GridSearchCV":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GridSearchCV"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Performs parallel Grid Search over a hyperparameter grid for DecisionTreeClassifier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to find the best hyperparameter combination via Stratified K-Fold Cross-Validation.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/gridsearchcv","title":"GridSearchCV","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/GridSearchCV","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GridSearchCV"}]},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/RandomizedSearchCV":{"title":"RandomizedSearchCV","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Performs parallel Randomized Search over random hyperparameter combinations"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"via K-Fold Cross-Validation.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/randomizedsearchcv","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RandomizedSearchCV"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RandomizedSearchCV"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/RandomizedSearchCV","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/CrossValidationFolds":{"title":"Cross-Validation Strategies","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/crossvalidationfolds","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/CrossValidationFolds","role":"article","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Evaluate model stability and generalization performance across dataset splits using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KFold"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StratifiedKFold"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimeSeriesSplit"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/ParallelModelSelection":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/ParallelModelSelection","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/parallelmodelselection","abstract":[{"text":"Harness all available Apple Silicon CPU and GPU cores using structured Swift Concurrency ","type":"text"},{"code":"TaskGroup","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" primitives.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"article","title":"Concurrent Model Selection & Cross-Validation","role":"collectionGroup"},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/StratifiedKFold":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StratifiedKFold","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Stratified K-Fold cross-validator."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provides train\/validation indices such that class proportions are preserved in each fold."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/stratifiedkfold","title":"StratifiedKFold","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/StratifiedKFold","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"StratifiedKFold","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/KFold":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KFold"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Splits a dataset into K folds for cross-validation."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/kfold","title":"KFold","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/KFold","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KFold"}]},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"AutoML, Cross-Validation Folds & Hyperparameter Tuning."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"SwiftOptimize","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize"},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/EvaluationHarness":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/EvaluationHarness","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EvaluationHarness"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/evaluationharness","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Unified Classifier & Regressor Evaluation Metrics Harness (G-019)."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"EvaluationHarness","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EvaluationHarness"}],"role":"symbol"}}}